  storyTag: P76 character, day 1
  greeting: Inspector Vaal Korr, Border Authority. Today I watch you work - starting
    with me. Check my papers, then stamp them.
  answers:
  - key: purpose
    line: Inspection. Of you, as it happens.
  - key: route
    line: Sorv Deep. Direct. Inspectors don't change ships.
  - key: issued
    line: The Border Authority signs its own papers. Note that down.
  reactionAdmitted: Good. Carry on.
  reactionDenied: My papers were in order, officer. It's in my report. Carry on.
